patterns.explanation:
The method '{}' belongs to an object (it's not static), but you're trying to call it directly from a static method (like 'main'). You must first create an object of the class, then call the method on it:
  MyClass obj = new MyClass();
  obj.{}();

The variable '{}' belongs to an object (it's not static), but you're trying to use it from a static method (like 'main'). Either make the variable 'static', or create an object of the class first:
  MyClass obj = new MyClass();
  System.out.println(obj.{});
